      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:75mmcz'
    '|b||And here''s what I''d call the real import. A taste is private, but norms are made and policed by other people, so they can shift, and identity says where to look.':
